                        "entry_id": "406d6489-c245-3c88-a11d-12ea6017c6ec",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "préférables"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "81ef5cb7-d4be-3ced-a03a-b1acf8bd425d",
                        "entry_id": "406d6489-c245-3c88-a11d-12ea6017c6ec",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui mérite d’être préféré ; qui doit être préféré."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9c2a5db9-f4a5-4b58-8b63-56a348c8037a",
                                "sense_id": "81ef5cb7-d4be-3ced-a03a-b1acf8bd425d",
                                "text": "Quand on emploie l’albumine comme moyen d’émulsionner, on a recours au blanc d’œuf, et plus souvent encore au jaune d’œuf ; ces corps sont même préférables à la gomme, quand il s'agit de diviser une huile épaisse et visqueuse comme celle des ricins ; […]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7ee04cc3-5e65-4162-8089-6d01dd03f5e6",
                                "sense_id": "81ef5cb7-d4be-3ced-a03a-b1acf8bd425d",
                                "text": "Peu de consommateurs savent que les choux d'York, pain de sucre et cœur de bœuf, sont préférables sous le rapport de la saveur a toutes les autres espèces, quand on les laisse pommer complétement."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "989f7e1e-5529-4112-af8a-5aacac2fb52e",
                                "sense_id": "81ef5cb7-d4be-3ced-a03a-b1acf8bd425d",
                                "text": "La reproduction par semis, même sous cloche, est très-difficile et très-lente à notre climat; la propagation par marcottes, et surtout par éclats, est de beaucoup préférable."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "06f4efe8-298c-4c4a-906a-936551e8c626",
                                "sense_id": "81ef5cb7-d4be-3ced-a03a-b1acf8bd425d",
                                "text": "Si misérable que soit l’abri dont on dispose, il est encore préférable à la bise glacée."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "edb21b88-7f27-4243-a83a-5c0de79eb06f",
                        "source_entry_id": "406d6489-c245-3c88-a11d-12ea6017c6ec",
                        "source_sense_id": "81ef5cb7-d4be-3ced-a03a-b1acf8bd425d",
                        "target_lang_word": "preferable",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "preferable",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5fbefe8b-2a49-3813-8a7f-44ba334266d8",
                                        "entry_id": "911b16c4-dac2-35ec-b27f-8d04bf999fb5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Better than some other option; preferred."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "06eba912-5e0a-496e-973f-75e01ff0b9d2",
                                                "sense_id": "5fbefe8b-2a49-3813-8a7f-44ba334266d8",
                                                "text": "This work has been the care and ſtudy of ſome years; as far as health, and other affairs, would permit. For, this appeared, to the author, of as much greater importance, than any other hiſtory whatever; as morality and religion are more excellent, than any temporal affairs; and the hiſtory of true religion, præferrable to that of impoſtures and deluſions."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5893b223-f834-4052-9f97-5c7c204ef244",
                                                "sense_id": "5fbefe8b-2a49-3813-8a7f-44ba334266d8",
                                                "text": "It is not to the point that an inequality of material goods, at high levels, may not be preferable to an equality of material goods at a lower level, precisely for such reasons as self-respect."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "90289261-d1ba-43d3-8bf7-4f216f22b66c",
                                                "sense_id": "5fbefe8b-2a49-3813-8a7f-44ba334266d8",
                                                "text": "While adopting the pronoun as a nonbinary description is vastly preferable for some, Merriam-Webster says, there has also been some debate that it is ungrammatical."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3fa0c3a2-2213-4a2e-96c3-6997deedefbb",
                                                "sense_id": "5fbefe8b-2a49-3813-8a7f-44ba334266d8",
                                                "text": "If you’re looking for the most breathable mask, Lukovics says, “Cotton is preferable, mainly for absorbing moisture/sweat.” She says multiple layers may be more protective but will also impact breathability."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5f05801d-6f32-4c0f-8c0a-f894893c901d",
                        "source_entry_id": "406d6489-c245-3c88-a11d-12ea6017c6ec",
                        "source_sense_id": "81ef5cb7-d4be-3ced-a03a-b1acf8bd425d",
                        "target_lang_word": "preferible",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "preferible",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c129b543-d81c-3436-9e10-183da8d977fa",
                                        "entry_id": "cf6acc5d-9f2b-305e-aa36-bcb03350ae51",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Digno de preferirse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df6e06f2-8645-4dee-955c-80ee7764b3e5",
                                                "sense_id": "c129b543-d81c-3436-9e10-183da8d977fa",
                                                "text": "«Los topónimos México y Texas, y sus derivados, presentan variantes ortográficas con -j-; también válidas: Méjico, Tejas, mejicano, tejano, etc. En el caso de México y sus derivados, las grafías con -x- resultan preferibles por ser las usadas en el propio país y hoy ya, de forma mayoritaria, en el resto del ámbito hispánico»."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a9a0134-a019-4833-b314-66f257530887",
                                                "sense_id": "c129b543-d81c-3436-9e10-183da8d977fa",
                                                "text": "«Estas invenciones dan dinero y poder, dominio material; pero esto ¿qué vale? ¿Qué importa que salga luz del corazón y del cerebro, si para ver lo que vemos sería preferible vivir a oscuras? Si yo supiera crear fuego * en todos los corazones e ideas nobles y generosas en todos los cerebros, ¡esta sí que sería una invención maravillosa!»."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "95ab071e-a756-4027-a469-b8420ce7dc80",
                        "source_entry_id": "406d6489-c245-3c88-a11d-12ea6017c6ec",
